WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Connect. Represent travel possibilities as nodes, edges and minute costs.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Reroute. Remove one bridge and recompute routes to the same destination.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Compare. Show who gains travel time and how a threshold changes covered-node counts.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Test. Vary speed assumptions before asking an optional model to interpret computed evidence.
